ed base and candidate repo copies; this narrows both checkouts without weakening the trust boundary.\n\n## Trust Boundary Notes\nThis keeps the #1470/#1480 model intact:\n- PR-capable guard remains on `ubuntu-latest`, not self-hosted.\n- Guard code still runs from trusted base checkout.\n- Candidate PR code is only inspected as data.\n- `persist-credentials: false` remains set.\n\nThis PR modifies protected guard files, so the current guard may block it by design. It needs maintainer/trusted handling, then PR #1482 can rerun CI Security Guard.\n\n## Validation\n- `python3 tests/security/test_ci_security_guard_workflow_integrity.py`\n- `python3 tests/security/test_check_no_self_hosted_pull_request.py`\n- `python3 scripts/security/check_no_self_hosted_pull_request.py .github/workflows`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`","created_at":"2026-07-08T14:48:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T14:53:01Z","closed_at":"2026-07-08T14:53:00Z","merged_at":"2026-07-08T14:53:00Z","merge_commit_sha":"89218254d4162d5cbdf3f750591a83ebb06df1fb","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1483/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1483/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1483/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/4b0b7727a66d49f9bd5b00ad75ca89c49bd6a2b9","head":{"label":"Samsen879:codex/ci-security-guard-sparse-checkout","ref":"codex/ci-security-guard-sparse-checkout","sha":"4b0b7727a66d49f9bd5b00ad75ca89c49bd6a2b9","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","